# With no timestamps, a SYN in TIME_WAIT at or before RCV.NXT (2 here) may be
# an old duplicate: a challenge ACK (RFC 5961 4), and still TIME_WAIT. The
# comparison is modular, so 4294967000 is before 2, not after it.
0      listen 8080
+0     < S 0:0(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > S. 0:0(0) ack 1 <mss 1460>
+0.005 < . 1:1(0) ack 1 win 65535
+0     accept

+0.010 close
+0     > F. 1:1(0) ack 1
+0.005 < . 1:1(0) ack 2 win 65535
+0.005 < F. 1:1(0) ack 2 win 65535
+0     > . 2:2(0) ack 2
+0     state TIME_WAIT

+1     < S 2:2(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 2:2(0) ack 2
+0     state TIME_WAIT
+0.010 < S 4294967000:4294967000(0) win 65535 <mss 1460>
+0     > . 2:2(0) ack 2
+0     state TIME_WAIT
